<title>USA: YPF Sociedad Anonima files for 35.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>YPF Sociedad Anonima files for 35.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>YPF Sociedad Anonima said Wednesday it has filed a shelf registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for the sale of up to 35.3 million American Depository shares, at least 33.4 million of which will be sold in an offering underwritten by Salomon Brothers Inc.</p>
</text>
